          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="lt-list">
          <li><span class="lt-check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/Vector.svg?v=1766611779"></span>No bamboo rayon</li>
          <li><span class="lt-check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/Vector.svg?v=1766611779"></span>No plastic film layers</li>
          <li><span class="lt-check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/Vector.svg?v=1766611779"></span>No polyethylene or polypropylene substrates</li>
          <li><span class="lt-check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/Vector.svg?v=1766611779"></span>No questionable eco claims masking chemical processing</li>
          <li><span class="lt-check" aria-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/5542/9998/files/Vector.svg?v=1766611779"></span>Just a simple, breathable fabric that feels good on the skin.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="lt-h2">Tested as a Complete Finished Product —<br>Not Just the Adhesive</h2>

        <p class="lt-p">Some brands test an ingredient or an adhesive component separately.</p>
        <p class="lt-p">We test the entire tape exactly as you use it — including:</p>

        <ul class="lt-list">
          <li>
            <span class="lt-check" aria-hidden="true">
